      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it would cause a problem. My concerns were that this function is called both in interrupt context and not. I need to go back over the potential paths. Also, I wasn\u0027t clear what the SM32_I2C transmit fifo was like. Is it 1 byte? And does it actually get cleared by setting CR1_TXIE like the comment on line 231?",
